          "id": "DC_kwDOKrJqmc4A78Ef",
          "body": "I mean to say that I'm almost certain it will work, but it's not obvious to me why rayhunter should support it:\r\n\r\n* Adding such a device without a dedicated maintainer who owns the device is not sustainable.\r\n* Since it's expensive, not many people will have it.\r\n\r\nFor many other devices either one of the two is true:\r\n\r\n* There is a dedicated maintainer who shows up and fixes bugs\r\n* The device is strategically important because it's widely available or cheap\r\n\r\nThere are exceptions but they didn't start out this way",
          "author": {
